<translate>
==== CantAttackWithLowestEndurance ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is set to true, then the player will not be able to attack with this item if endurance is very low.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
CantAttackWithLowestEndurance = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

